### AUDIO EQUIPMENT & ACOUSTIC SAFETY RIDER
THE SOFTWARE CONTROLS PHYSICAL HARDWARE GAIN STAGES, MOTORIZED FADERS, AND
MONITOR OUTPUT LEVELS. BY USING THIS SOFTWARE, YOU ACKNOWLEDGE AND AGREE THAT:
1. SUDDEN VOLUME LEVEL JUMPS, FEEDBACK BURSTS, OR UNMUTED SIGNALS CAN OCCUR
   DUE TO SOFTWARE, HARDWARE, OR OPERATOR ERROR.
2. HIGH SOUND PRESSURE LEVELS (SPL) CAN CAUSE PERMANENT, IRREVERSIBLE HEARING
   DAMAGE (ACOUSTIC TRAUMA, TINNITUS) AND DESTRUCTION OF AUDIO MONITORS,
   SPEAKERS, SUBWOOFERS, OR HEADPHONE DRIVERS.
3. YOU ARE PERSONALLY RESPONSIBLE FOR ENSURING ANALOG VOLUME CONTROLLERS ARE
   ATTENUATED PRIOR TO OPERATING THIS SOFTWARE, AND THAT MOTORIZED FADER TRAVEL
   PATHS ARE UNOBSTRUCTED.

